---
import Base from '../../../../layouts/Base.astro';

// /metadax/guide/any-ai/ -- the plain-prompt route for any capable AI chat.
// Content tracks prompt.md's own front-matter instructions. No vendor named.
---
<Base title="Use Meta DAX with any AI chat" description="Open one plain prompt, paste it into any capable AI assistant you already pay for, and save the lesson package it builds." wide>
  <section class="lede">
    <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/metadax/">Meta DAX</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/metadax/guide/">Help</a> &rsaquo; Any AI chat</p>
    <h1>Use any AI chat</h1>
    <p class="lede-text">
      No special skill needed. Everything the Claude skill does is also written as
      one plain prompt you can paste into any capable AI assistant you already pay
      for. The task uses no features specific to any one product.
    </p>
    <p class="lede-note">
      Prefer to install it once? There is also a <a href="/metadax/guide/claude-skill/">Claude skill</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-copy">
    <h2 id="h-copy">1. Open the prompt</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Open the plain text file &mdash; it&rsquo;s the whole prompt, ready to copy:
    </p>
    <p class="out">
      <a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/daxfoundation/metadax/main/skills/metadax-homeschool/prompt.md">Open the plain text, ready to copy &rarr;</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/daxfoundation/metadax/blob/main/skills/metadax-homeschool/prompt.md">View on GitHub</a>
    </p>
    <p class="body">Select all and copy.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-paste">
    <h2 id="h-paste">2. Paste and send</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Start a new chat in the AI assistant you already use. Paste it as your first
      message, type <strong>Start</strong> under it, and send. If your chat turns a
      long paste into an attachment, that&rsquo;s fine; the &ldquo;Start&rdquo; line
      tells it to begin.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-answer">
    <h2 id="h-answer">3. Answer its questions</h2>
    <p class="body">
      It asks about a dozen questions, a few at a time. Nothing identifying: a
      made-up nickname, no real name, school, town, email or phone. Your answers go
      to that AI service under its own privacy settings; the package file you get
      stays with you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-play">
    <h2 id="h-play">4. Play it</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Copy the package JSON it gives you, open the player, paste it into the box
      and press Play. Read your tab first; your child plays theirs with you beside
      them.
    </p>
    <p class="out">
      <a href="/metadax/play/">Open the player &rarr;</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/metadax/guide/play-and-print/">How to play and print</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/metadax/guide/no-ai/">No AI at all? Use the questionnaire</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/metadax/guide/">Back to the guide</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede { padding-block: 3rem 2rem; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .eyebrow a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .eyebrow a:hover, .eyebrow a:focus-visible { color: var(--fg); }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2.6vw, 2.75rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.22; letter-spacing: -0.012em; max-width: 20em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .lede-text { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; color: #cfcfcf; }
  .lede-note { margin: 0.75rem 0 0; max-width: 40em; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .lede-note a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); }
  .lede-note a:hover, .lede-note a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }

  .block { padding-block: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); scroll-margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg); }
  .body { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; color: #cfcfcf; }
  .body + .body, .body + .out, .out + .body { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .body a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); }
  .body a:hover, .body a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }

  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 8%, transparent); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 4px; }

  .out { margin: 1.25rem 0 0; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .out span { color: var(--faint); margin-inline: 0.5rem; }
  .out a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); }
  .out a:hover, .out a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }
</style>
